The '''Shark Saw''' is an {{Uncommon}} [[Sword]].

Often obtained by players early on, Shark Saw is decent for [[First Sea]] grinding.

==Obtainment==
The Shark Saw is a weapon that has a chance to be obtained as a drop after defeating [[The Saw]], a boss that spawns in [[Middle Town]] in the [[First Sea]]. The Saw spawns for a duration of 15 minutes at intervals of 1 hour and 15 minutes. Players are eligible for the drop only if they have inflicted at least 10% of the total damage to the boss during the encounter.

